@BookingService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283
@eventId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1. Health check endpoint (prerequisito 11)
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Root API status endpoint
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 3. Swagger OpenAPI Specification
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 4. Available seats of the event (SP-04 / APP-01)
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/{{eventId}}/tickets/available
Accept: application/json

### 5. Availability of a single seat (SP-04 / API-03) - replace ticketId with one returned by request 4
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/{{eventId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### 6. Seat purchase (SP-05 / SP-06) - repeating it with the same key returns 200 with the same ticket
POST {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/{{eventId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/purchase
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}
